00:57:12.170 --> 00:57:27.130
<v Ashli Lewis>You're the one. When I tell you you're going to be successful, I don't mean kind of successful. I mean successful in a way that you rarely see. I mean really successful. And you just need to get ready.
<v Ashli Lewis>就是你了。当我告诉你你会成功时，我指的不是那种程度的成功。我指的是你鲜少见到的那种成功。我指的是真正的成功。你只需要做好准备。

00:57:27.130 --> 00:57:32.130
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。
